Usage: tsci registry packages update [options]

Update a package in the tscircuit registry

Options:
  --package-name <packageName>       Package name to update
  --enable-public-dist               Enable public dist
  --disable-public-dist              Disable public dist
  --github-repo <owner/repo-or-url>  Link a GitHub repository by owner/repo or
                                     URL
  --unlink-github                    Remove the linked GitHub repository
  -h, --help                         display help for command
